#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:11
msgid "Tune the PhysX Solver"
msgstr "PhysX 求解器调优"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:13
msgid ""
"Use this guide after the PhysX backend can construct the task and its "
"assets. Before changing solver settings, reproduce one issue with a fixed "
"initial state, seed, and action sequence. Record the failure, contact "
"behavior, and task metric for that reproduction, then change one scene-level"
" setting at a time. The generated API documentation for "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` remains authoritative for exact "
"fields and current defaults."
msgstr ""
"本指南适用于 PhysX "
"后端已能构建任务和资产的情况。修改求解器设置前，用固定的初始状态、随机种子和动作序列复现一个问题。记录该复现场景中的故障、接触行为和任务指标，再逐项调整场景级设置。具体字段及其当前默认值，以"
" :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 的自动生成 API 文档为准。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:22
msgid "Start from an explicit baseline"
msgstr "建立明确的基准配置"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:24
msgid ""
"Make the scene-level PhysX choices visible in the task configuration first. "
"This baseline is a representative starting point for a contact-rich task, "
"not a universal recommendation:"
msgstr "先在任务配置中明确场景级 PhysX 设置。以下基准配置是接触密集任务的一个代表性起点，并非通用建议："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:48
msgid ""
"Keep per-actor properties such as contact materials, articulation iteration "
"counts, and USD-authored collision settings on the schema configuration "
"side; scene-level PhysX tuning does not replace that authoring path."
msgstr "接触材料、关节体迭代次数和 USD 中编写的碰撞设置等各对象属性，仍应放在模式配置中；场景级 PhysX 调优不能替代这些属性的编写。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:53
msgid "Choose TGS or PGS"
msgstr "选择 TGS 或 PGS"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:55
msgid ""
"Keep ``solver_type=1`` (TGS) as the first candidate for articulated robots "
"and contact-rich manipulation. TGS is the established default and usually "
"gives the best stability for modern Isaac Lab tasks. Compare "
"``solver_type=0`` (PGS) only when the fixed reproduction still shows poor "
"behavior after validating the asset, controller, and contact geometry, or "
"when a stiff legacy asset behaves better with PGS."
msgstr ""
"对于关节式机器人和接触密集的操作任务，优先尝试 ``solver_type=1`` （TGS）。TGS 是既有默认选项，通常能为较新的 Isaac "
"Lab 任务提供最佳稳定性。只有验证资产、控制器和接触几何后，固定的复现场景仍表现不佳，或较早的高刚度资产在 PGS 下表现更好时，才比较 "
"``solver_type=0`` （PGS）。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:62
msgid ""
"If a grasping or stiff-contact workload remains sensitive after the solver "
"choice is fixed, test ``solve_articulation_contact_last`` on the same "
"reproduction and keep it only when it measurably improves the recorded "
"contact or task metric."
msgstr ""
"如果确定求解器类型后，抓取或高刚度接触负载仍然敏感，可在同一复现场景中测试 ``solve_articulation_contact_last`` "
"。只有它确实改善了记录的接触或任务指标，才保留这一设置。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:68
msgid "Tune solver iterations"
msgstr "调整求解迭代次数"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:70
msgid ""
"PhysX clamps each actor's solver work through the scene-level iteration "
"ranges: ``min_position_iteration_count`` and "
"``max_position_iteration_count`` for position iterations, plus "
"``min_velocity_iteration_count`` and ``max_velocity_iteration_count`` for "
"velocity iterations."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 通过场景级迭代范围限制各对象的求解计算量：位置迭代使用 ``min_position_iteration_count`` 和 "
"``max_position_iteration_count`` ，速度迭代使用 ``min_velocity_iteration_count`` 和 "
"``max_velocity_iteration_count`` 。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:75
msgid ""
"Increase position iterations first when the fixed reproduction shows "
"penetration, joint constraint drift, or grasp instability. Increase velocity"
" iterations only when the same reproduction shows unstable restitution or a "
"velocity-level convergence issue that position iterations do not correct. "
"Stop when the measured behavior plateaus; more iterations cannot repair "
"invalid collision geometry, reset overlap, or a controller that injects "
"instability."
msgstr ""
"当固定的复现场景出现穿透、关节约束漂移或抓取不稳定时，先增加位置迭代次数。只有同一场景出现不稳定的恢复响应，或位置迭代无法解决的速度层面收敛问题时，才增加速度迭代次数。在实测行为不再改善时停止；更多迭代无法修复无效碰撞几何、重置时的重叠，或由控制器引入的不稳定。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:83
msgid "Tune contacts and stability"
msgstr "调整接触与稳定性"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:85
msgid ""
"Validate colliders, material properties, and reset overlap before changing "
"scene-wide contact settings. Then use the same fixed reproduction to tune:"
msgstr "修改场景全局接触设置前，先验证碰撞体、材料属性和重置时的重叠，再使用同一固定复现场景调整以下参数："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:88
msgid ""
"``enable_ccd`` for fast-moving bodies that tunnel through thin geometry when"
" using CPU dynamics. CCD is not supported with GPU dynamics; Isaac Lab "
"forces it off and emits a warning if ``enable_ccd=True`` is requested on a "
"GPU simulation."
msgstr ""
"``enable_ccd`` 适用于 CPU 动力学中穿过薄几何体的高速运动刚体。GPU 动力学不支持 CCD；如果 GPU 仿真请求 "
"``enable_ccd=True`` ，Isaac Lab 会强制关闭它并发出警告。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:92
msgid ""
"``enable_stabilization`` only for low-rate simulations where ``dt`` is "
"larger than about ``1 / 30`` seconds; this extra pass can make reported "
"contact-sensor force magnitudes inaccurate, so keep it disabled when those "
"forces are part of the observation or evaluation path."
msgstr ""
"``enable_stabilization`` 仅适用于 ``dt`` 大于约 ``1 / 30`` "
"秒的低频仿真。这项额外处理可能使接触传感器报告的力大小不准确；如果观测或评估使用这些力，应保持禁用。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:96
msgid ""
"``bounce_threshold_velocity`` [m/s] for the relative speed above which "
"contacts bounce."
msgstr "``bounce_threshold_velocity`` [m/s]：接触发生回弹所需的相对速度阈值。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:98
msgid ""
"``friction_offset_threshold`` [m] for the contact distance at which PhysX "
"starts applying friction forces."
msgstr "``friction_offset_threshold`` [m]：PhysX 开始施加摩擦力的接触距离。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:100
msgid ""
"``friction_correlation_distance`` [m] for the distance used to merge nearby "
"contacts into one friction anchor."
msgstr "``friction_correlation_distance`` [m]：将邻近接触合并到同一摩擦锚点所使用的距离。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:103
msgid ""
"Treat each of these as a measured contact-model change. Recheck penetration,"
" slip, bounce, contact counts, task success, and runtime after every "
"adjustment."
msgstr "这些设置都会改变接触模型，应以测量为依据。每次调整后，重新检查穿透、滑移、回弹、接触数、任务成功率和运行耗时。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:107
msgid "Size GPU buffers"
msgstr "确定 GPU 缓冲区容量"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:109
msgid ""
"Most PhysX GPU scene-buffer capacities are fixed and do not grow "
"dynamically. When a scene exceeds one of these capacities, PhysX can drop "
"contacts or fail with a ``[PhysX]`` warning. Treat those warnings as hard "
"failures for the reproduction and increase only the capacity that "
"overflowed."
msgstr ""
"多数 PhysX GPU 场景缓冲区的容量固定，不会动态增长。当场景超出其中某项容量时，PhysX 可能丢弃接触，或发出 ``[PhysX]`` "
"警告并失败。在复现场景中，应将这类警告视为必须解决的故障，只增加溢出的那项容量。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:114
msgid ""
"The most common fixed capacities to raise for large vectorized or contact-"
"rich scenes are:"
msgstr "对于大型向量化场景或接触密集场景，最常需要提高的固定容量如下："

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:117
msgid "``gpu_max_rigid_contact_count``"
msgstr "``gpu_max_rigid_contact_count``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:118
msgid "``gpu_max_rigid_patch_count``"
msgstr "``gpu_max_rigid_patch_count``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:119
msgid "``gpu_found_lost_pairs_capacity``"
msgstr "``gpu_found_lost_pairs_capacity``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:120
msgid "``gpu_found_lost_aggregate_pairs_capacity``"
msgstr "``gpu_found_lost_aggregate_pairs_capacity``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:121
msgid "``gpu_total_aggregate_pairs_capacity``"
msgstr "``gpu_total_aggregate_pairs_capacity``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:122
msgid "``gpu_collision_stack_size``"
msgstr "``gpu_collision_stack_size``"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:124
msgid ""
"``gpu_heap_capacity`` is different: it sets the initial capacity of the GPU "
"and pinned-host-memory heaps, and PhysX allocates additional memory when "
"those heaps need to grow. Increase the initial heap capacity when "
"measurements show that repeated growth is undesirable, not because it is a "
"fixed upper bound."
msgstr ""
"``gpu_heap_capacity`` 不同：它设置 GPU 内存堆和页锁定主机内存堆的初始容量；需要扩容时，PhysX "
"会继续分配内存。只有测量表明反复扩容不合适时，才提高初始堆容量，不应把它当作固定上限。"

#: source/how-to/solver_tuning_physx.rst:129
msgid ""
"Measure the busiest reset and contact state, add task-specific headroom, and"
" then verify that the same fixed reproduction remains stable. Buffer sizing "
"cannot correct invalid geometry, solver divergence, or a controller issue."
msgstr "测量重置和接触最密集的状态，为任务预留余量，再验证相同的固定复现场景仍然稳定。调整缓冲区容量无法修复无效几何、求解器发散或控制器问题。"

